- Running this software as part of a commercial product, platform, or business infrastructure
- Using this software to develop or test proprietary or commercial software

Examples of noncommercial purposes include:

- Personal use and private study
- Educational use by students and teachers
- Research and hobbyist experimentation
- Non-profit and community contributions without commercial compensation

